 p.reload();p.evaluate('phone126.groceries()');assert p.get_by_role('switch',name='Group by meal',exact=True).is_checked();assert sum(s['checked'] for s in p.evaluate('phone126.sources("both")'))==1
 # Both scale switches have actual visible thumbs, draft values cancel with browser Back.
